// Roster wave 3 — EVOLUTION EDGES. DATA, not code (ADR-0006/0057/0174/0176/0204).
// This part file OWNS THE edge_id BAND 100..=199; 000-core.ron owns 1..=99.
// edge_ids are author-assigned, unique and APPEND-ONLY (EG1-4/EG1-12,
// ADR-0176 D1) — never reused, never renumbered, even if an edge is removed.
//
// min_level is the Level newtype, deserialized from a bare u8 in [1, 100]:
// write it as a plain number, never as a wrapped tuple.
//
// AUTHORING RULE (ADR-0176 D2) — auto-evolution makes level a RACE. A monster
// with exactly one currently-eligible path evolves automatically and
// immediately, so an unconditional low-min_level edge silently kills every
// higher-level sibling branch out of the same species. Wave 3 gives each base
// form EXACTLY ONE outgoing edge, which makes that race vacuous by
// construction — the safe default, and the reason neither edge below needs a
// second gate to be honest. Both are non-vacuous under R4 purely on min_level,
// which is above the Level floor of 1.
//
// COMMENT HYGIENE: full-line comments only, and never a bare id field name in
// prose — use the edge=N / species=N form.
[
    // ---- species=40 Voltkit, tier 0 -> species=41 Voltarion --------------
    //
    // Plain level gate, no essence and no Trust component. Level 20 is the
    // registry's common-branch convention (edge=1, edge=3, edge=4, edge=7 all
    // sit there), and a glass cannon that arrives earlier would outclass the
    // wave-1 and wave-2 lines during their own level window.
    (
        edge_id: 100,
        from_species: 40,
        to_species: 41,
        min_level: 20,
        essence: [],
        min_trust_tier: None,
        min_quality_time_tier: None,
        min_nutrition_pct: None,
    ),
    // ---- species=42 Aurelet, tier 0 -> species=43 Aurelith ---------------
    //
    // Level 22, matching edge=9 (the other plain-level branch in the registry).
    // Two levels above the Electric branch because the Light line's payoff is
    // bulk, which compounds: arriving at the same level as the cannon would
    // make the wall strictly the better early pick.
    (
        edge_id: 101,
        from_species: 42,
        to_species: 43,
        min_level: 22,
        essence: [],
        min_trust_tier: None,
        min_quality_time_tier: None,
        min_nutrition_pct: None,
    ),
]
